00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.802
No, it wasn't like that at all!

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:19.306
It's true that Saji asked me to lie.

00:02:19.306 --> 00:02:22.643
And there were things | didn't tell you.

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:25.145
But | did it for your sake.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.947
For my sake?

00:02:26.947 --> 00:02:31.952
"Episode 9
The Bigger Odds Wins, the Smaller Odds Loses"

00:02:33.787 --> 00:02:38.659
| heard about your relationship
with Saji in the past.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:45.432
That's why you're afraid of
my remembering the past.

00:02:45.432 --> 00:02:50.671
Saji asked me not to fell you that
he and | were seeing each other.

00:02:50.671 --> 00:02:52.873
But he said this, too...

00:02:52.873 --> 00:02:58.045
Even if my memory refurns, we can't
go back to being a couple again.

00:02:58.045 --> 00:03:02.482
He said he can't have feelings
for anyone but you, Ryomou.

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:06.153
Then why did that bastard run off and disappear?!

00:03:06.153 --> 00:03:11.658
Saji is working to unravel
the mystery of why I'm still alive.

00:03:11.658 --> 00:03:15.595
He says he can't see you
unfil he solves that mystery.

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:16.897
That bastard...

00:03:16.897 --> 00:03:19.666
He could've at least said something...

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.234
What's so funny?

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:27.207
Isn't that sort of vanity what guys do?
They can't just come out and tell you.

00:03:33.847 --> 00:03:36.483
Isn't that what you love about him?

00:03:36.483 --> 00:03:38.485
W-What're you talking about?

00:03:38.485 --> 00:03:39.786
Did you know?

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:44.191
Saji won't fell you because
he doesn't want you to worry.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:51.498
| even told him that it doesn't matter
anymore about why I'm still alive.

00:03:51.498 --> 00:03:52.966
Doesn't matter anymore?

00:03:52.966 --> 00:03:57.604
Because... | don't need to know my past anymore.

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:59.072
Ever since | met you,

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:02.943
the time we've spent together
is more important fo me.

00:04:02.943 --> 00:04:04.311
Ryofu...

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:10.417
Going back and seeing Rakuyo
in ruins made it clear to me...

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:13.420
That place was dark and cold...

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.921
