00:04:16.323 --> 00:04:25.265
Ryomou... when I'm with you, I'm free
of the shackles of my past. But...

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:26.333
But?

00:04:28.635 --> 00:04:32.873
If this Saji thing bothers yovu...

00:04:32.873 --> 00:04:36.743
..you don't want to be around me, do you?

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:40.380
l... | love you...

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.583
| couldn't bear having you
hate me any more than this...

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:46.887
That's why I'm saying goodbye to you now...

00:04:48.355 --> 00:04:49.589
Wait!

00:04:55.896 --> 00:04:57.831
| won't doubt you anymore...

00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:02.602
You'll frust me, then?

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:04.471
Thank you!

00:05:04.471 --> 00:05:07.374
So we can be together from now on?

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.823
Miss Ryofu did?

00:05:22.823 --> 00:05:26.059
Yes, that's what Ryuu-chan said.

00:05:31.464 --> 00:05:37.437
It'll be okay, Ryuu-chan..
Don't cry... They're not fatal wounds...

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:39.072
But... but...

00:05:39.072 --> 00:05:42.542
What could've happened?

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:47.180
That day... Miss Ryofu invited
us to the amusement park...

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:53.353
We all went inside the
haunted castle, and Miss Ryofu...

00:05:53.353 --> 00:05:55.155
What happened?

00:05:55.155 --> 00:05:57.424
It's too horrible to tell you!

00:05:57.424 --> 00:05:59.693
Don't look at me.

00:05:59.693 --> 00:06:01.895
That's when it happened...

00:06:01.895 --> 00:06:06.132
Someone entered my body, and I..

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:10.971
It's my fault that this happened
to Kan and everyone else!

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:19.012
Someone entered her body...

00:06:20.547 --> 00:06:23.817
When was it?

00:06:26.586 --> 00:06:28.221
Chubo?

00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:30.857
L-Let's go, Big Brother Koukin.

00:06:35.462 --> 00:06:40.300
Chubo was definitely acting
strangely when she met Ryofu.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.637
What was she so frightened of?

00:06:43.637 --> 00:06:46.373
Koukin! Let's go visit Fuu-charl

00:06:46.373 --> 00:06:47.507
Oh, okay.

00:06:47.507 --> 00:06:49.843
You'd be wasting your time.

00:06:49.843 --> 00:06:51.511
Riku-chan.

00:06:51.511 --> 00:06:53.980
Who is this person?

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.117
Hakugen Rikuson, our tactician.

00:06:57.117 --> 00:07:01.021
Hosen Ryofu already left Big Sister Mou's room.

00:07:01.021 --> 00:07:04.991
And, she's just being manipulated by someone.

00:07:04.991 --> 00:07:07.360
Did you say... manipulated?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.062
By whom, Rikuson?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.232
Genpo Saj.

00:07:12.232 --> 00:07:14.834
By Saji? Why?

00:07:14.834 --> 00:07:18.872
The person you call Saji is Saji, but not Saji.

00:07:18.872 --> 00:07:19.906
Huh?

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:23.743
The guy's real name is Shishi Quin,

00:07:23.743 --> 00:07:27.881
He took the alias "Shishi Ouin"
in order to defeat Chuei Totaku.

00:07:27.881 --> 00:07:33.153
Uh... could you say that so if's easier to understand?

00:07:33.153 --> 00:07:35.522
There's another Genpo Saji

00:07:35.522 --> 00:07:38.959
besides the one we know...
Is that what you're saying?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.905
Young Master!

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:55.542
You mustn'f!

00:07:55.542 --> 00:07:56.843
Shisonzui...

00:07:56.843 --> 00:08:01.381
It is too soon to don that sacred
bead and return to being Quin.

00:08:01.381 --> 00:08:04.484
Now that Totaku and Ryofu of Rakuyo are dead,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:09.356
what good would it do to continue living
my life as Genpo Saji, an assumed identity?

00:08:09.356 --> 00:08:16.596
Certainly, after Shishi Ouin of the Three
Kingdoms defeated Totaku using ‘Renkan no Kei”

00:08:16.596 --> 00:08:20.333
he fell victim to traitors under his command.

00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:24.537
| am Quin!

00:08:25.505 --> 00:08:31.144
That's precisely why | have to return to
being Ouin to accomplish what he could not.

00:08:31.144 --> 00:08:33.246
Yes, | will live.

00:08:33.246 --> 00:08:40.286
However, you are not simply living under an
assumed identity in order o deceive Tontaku.

00:08:40.286 --> 00:08:41.021
What?

00:08:41.021 --> 00:08:44.424
In the time of the Three Kingdoms,

00:08:44.424 --> 00:08:48.461
Genpo Saji used magical powers
to foretell Moutoku Sousou's death.

00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:52.432
If clay mice follow golden tigers,

00:08:52.432 --> 00:08:55.668
Kan'yu's life will end.

00:09:02.942 --> 00:09:07.047
Are you telling me to foretell
the death of Kyosho's Sousou?

00:09:07.047 --> 00:09:11.251
No, | am not. What you must do
as Genpo Saji, Young Master,

00:09:11.251 --> 00:09:13.586
is to meet the magician, Genpo Saj,

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:19.626
who will one day inherit the
sacred bead and appear in Kanto.

00:09:19.626 --> 00:09:22.629
And destroy him.

00:09:33.706 --> 00:09:34.641
Darn!

00:09:34.641 --> 00:09:41.147
Well, well, it seems Mou-c/han, the invincible
master of joint locks, sucks at games.

00:09:41.147 --> 00:09:44.317
I'm just off my game today!
I'm usually a lot better!

00:09:44.317 --> 00:09:46.453
Of course you are. Come on over here.

00:09:48.555 --> 00:09:50.623
How about some photos fogether?

00:09:52.392 --> 00:09:55.261
I-'m noft into that kind of thing!

00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:56.596
You think it's silly?

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:59.332
Th-That's not what | meant...

00:09:59.332 --> 00:10:01.301
Shall we forget it, then?

00:10:02.602 --> 00:10:04.104
Come on...

00:10:04.104 --> 00:10:06.172
You know you want to...

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:11.611
C'mon, smile, smile.

00:10:11.611 --> 00:10:13.179
Stop it!

00:10:17.117 --> 00:10:21.521
Who said you could stick
this on my cell phone?!

00:10:21.521 --> 00:10:24.057
What? You don't like it?

00:10:24.057 --> 00:10:26.025
Nobody said that...

00:10:26.025 --> 00:10:28.461
I'll take it off, then.

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:29.729
Anyhow...

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.066
Today... was fun.

00:10:33.066 --> 00:10:35.435
Huh? | couldn't hear you.

00:10:35.435 --> 00:10:37.137
Mind saying that again?

00:10:37.137 --> 00:10:39.272
D-Dummy!

00:10:39.272 --> 00:10:41.908
| had fun today!

00:10:41.908 --> 00:10:43.343
See you tomorrow!

00:10:43.343 --> 00:10:45.578
Bye-bye!

00:10:45.578 --> 00:10:47.380
Found you..

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:53.186
You finally showed up...

00:10:53.186 --> 00:10:55.155
Genpo Saj.

00:10:58.057 --> 00:11:00.226
Sousou's gone.

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:03.630
What makes you show up only now?

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.165
Shimei Ryomou.

00:11:06.866 --> 00:11:10.236
| want the dragon dormant inside her.

00:11:11.604 --> 00:11:13.439
What're you up to?

00:11:17.977 --> 00:11:20.146
They were doleful eyes.

00:11:20.146 --> 00:11:23.883
Loneliness, despair... and resentment...

00:11:23.883 --> 00:11:28.655
Those were the only things
those eyes ever saw...

00:11:28.655 --> 00:11:31.891
What is it you hope to make
me do by telling me that?

00:11:31.891 --> 00:11:36.162
You and | will work together...
that is a certainty.

00:11:36.162 --> 00:11:37.363
| will?

00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:41.201
That's absurd. And you call
yourself a fortune-teller?

00:11:41.201 --> 00:11:46.472
| can bring back your past that you treasure.

00:11:46.472 --> 00:11:48.641
My... past?

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:06.826
This... can't be!

00:12:09.462 --> 00:12:11.164
Hosen Ryofu...

00:12:12.398 --> 00:12:14.100
Is it...

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.936
..really possible to bring her back to life?

00:12:19.973 --> 00:12:21.341
Ryofu!

00:12:21.341 --> 00:12:23.543
It's me! Do you recognize me?

00:12:23.543 --> 00:12:24.911
Ryofu?

00:12:24.911 --> 00:12:28.948
| was able to restore her body, but...

00:12:28.948 --> 00:12:33.586
| was unable fo bring back her
memories. I'll need a bit more time.

00:12:39.926 --> 00:12:41.261
Hey!

00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:45.198
What's happening?

00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:51.271
Ryofu's memory, is it?

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:53.573
It hasn't completely come back yet.

00:12:53.573 --> 00:12:56.542
Then why is she fighting?

00:12:56.542 --> 00:13:01.347
Ryofu is under the control
of her fighter's instinct.

00:13:01.347 --> 00:13:02.582
What?

00:13:12.358 --> 00:13:14.594
Pull yourself together, Ryofu.

00:13:14.594 --> 00:13:17.196
A fighter's instincts are a frightening thing.

00:13:17.196 --> 00:13:25.638
Even though her memories haven't returned,
Ryofu's instincts demand an enemy to battle...

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:27.373
| will bring her memories back.

00:13:27.373 --> 00:13:29.175
What are you planning to do?

00:13:29.175 --> 00:13:32.145
- I'm going to let her meet Ryomou.
- You're going to let Shimei meet Ryomou?

00:13:32.145 --> 00:13:35.648
Ryofu once told Ryomou her deepest feelings.

00:13:35.648 --> 00:13:39.952
Ryofu has returned without her memories...

00:13:39.952 --> 00:13:42.655
Ryomou would never just leave her like this...

00:13:42.655 --> 00:13:45.291
Do you think that will bring
Ryofu's memories back?

00:13:45.291 --> 00:13:46.292
Yes...

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.662
It's possible.

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:53.299
Ryofu and Ryomou are both fighters.

00:13:55.101 --> 00:13:59.839
But Ryofu's memories didn't come back.

00:14:01.441 --> 00:14:05.812
| took a dangerous risk
and went to see her...

00:14:05.812 --> 00:14:09.415
| even revealed our past relationship, but...

00:14:15.521 --> 00:14:22.328
In the end, to Ryofu,
the memories of her life as a fighter

00:14:22.328 --> 00:14:25.765
