that bound her to her past.

00:14:39.178 --> 00:14:40.279
Hey!

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:43.783
Why're you laughing, creepo?!

00:14:43.783 --> 00:14:47.787
Oh, maybe you were
planning to eat that butterfly?

00:14:47.787 --> 00:14:50.523
It's perfect food for you, creepo!

00:15:06.172 --> 00:15:08.040
Go on, eat it!

00:15:10.877 --> 00:15:15.815
Aren't you going to eat it?
| caught it just for you.

00:15:22.922 --> 00:15:25.825
Doesn't she have strange powers?

00:15:26.692 --> 00:15:30.730
Wasn't that why terrible things
happened to that older student?

00:15:31.731 --> 00:15:34.233
W-What? Don't look at me!

00:15:34.233 --> 00:15:37.403
- Freak show!
- Go away!

00:15:37.403 --> 00:15:39.172
L-Let's not.

00:15:41.741 --> 00:15:43.042
