00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:46.245
Get away from here!

00:15:46.245 --> 00:15:48.948
Don't breathe our air!

00:15:48.948 --> 00:15:51.551
- You make me sick!
- Go away!

00:15:56.622 --> 00:15:57.990
Good for you!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.293
Get out of herel Scram!

00:16:15.074 --> 00:16:16.909
Stop it!

00:16:16.909 --> 00:16:18.878
Your arm is moving by itself!

00:16:18.878 --> 00:16:21.047
Ow! That hurt!

00:16:21.047 --> 00:16:25.384
- I'm sorry! | can't stop!
- My body's moving by itself!

00:16:37.096 --> 00:16:42.702
Ouin... don't leave me by myself.

00:16:42.702 --> 00:16:45.204
Don't go anywhere.

00:16:45.204 --> 00:16:47.473
Grant me my wish, please.

00:16:47.473 --> 00:16:49.742
Uh, okay...

00:16:52.845 --> 00:16:56.582
That's... Genpo Saji, the magician.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:03.122
So you're saying that the real Saji
used Fuu-chanto put a spell on Ryuu-chan

00:17:03.122 --> 00:17:06.392
in order to cause strife at Seitfo.

00:17:06.392 --> 00:17:08.661
You finally gof it.

00:17:08.661 --> 00:17:14.000
Yes. | did! So the real evil
is that magician, Saji, right?

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.536
I'm going there!

00:17:16.536 --> 00:17:18.070
Uh...

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.305
Going where?

00:17:19.305 --> 00:17:23.042
Isn't it obvious? To see Saji, the magician.

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:26.445
| can't let this terrible situation
continue! | have to make her stop!

00:17:26.445 --> 00:17:29.382
Do you know where she is?

00:17:29.382 --> 00:17:31.717
Huh? Don't you know, Riku-char?!

00:17:31.717 --> 00:17:33.519
Of course | don't.

00:17:33.519 --> 00:17:35.021
Why not?

00:17:35.021 --> 00:17:38.357
| struggled to get even this
much information, you know.

00:17:38.357 --> 00:17:39.859
Chubo.

00:17:44.497 --> 00:17:45.731
Rain...

00:18:01.314 --> 00:18:02.481
Ryofu?

00:18:25.705 --> 00:18:30.042
Even if my memories return, we can't
go back to being a couple again.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:35.815
He said he can't have feelings
for anyone but you, Ryomou.

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:40.653
| don't need to know my past anymore.

00:18:40.653 --> 00:18:45.858
Ever since | met you, the time we've
spent together is more important to me.

00:18:45.858 --> 00:18:48.427
You'll frust me, then?

00:18:48.427 --> 00:18:49.862
Thank you!

00:19:08.214 --> 00:19:09.382
Saji?!

00:19:18.958 --> 00:19:20.926
You bastard!

00:19:30.836 --> 00:19:35.608
Rage: the source of the dragon's power.

00:19:35.608 --> 00:19:42.381
Ryofu... you tricked me and
made a fool of me after all!

00:19:42.381 --> 00:19:45.384
What was it you told me back then?!

00:19:45.384 --> 00:19:49.722
We can't resist the fate that
the sacred beads have in store for us,

00:19:49.722 --> 00:19:54.293
but this path is one that | have fought for.

00:19:54.293 --> 00:19:58.597
That's right. For myself, and of my own free will.

00:19:59.532 --> 00:20:04.336
Then |, too, do this for myself
and of my own free will

00:20:04.336 --> 00:20:07.039
| will... defeat you!

00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:20.553
| cannot... allow you to kil her.

00:20:42.475 --> 00:20:43.876
Mou-char?!

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:27.686
Shimei Ryomou, you cannot
live of your own free will...

00:21:27.686 --> 00:21:32.792
Because you are the fighter with the dragon.

00:21:37.029 --> 00:21:39.999
"Episode 9
The End"

00:21:46.005 --> 00:21:51.877
Lla-laa.. laafa..

00:21:53.646 --> 00:21:59.552
Lla-laa.. laafa..

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:05.524
Wouldnt it be nice fo be able

00:22:05.524 --> 00:22:09.461
fo express everything in words?

00:22:09.461 --> 00:22:13.232
Werre like the sun and moon

00:22:13.232 --> 00:22:17.069
Holdling on fo sadness and happiness

00:22:17.069 --> 00:22:18.571
Faraway... Faraway...

00:22:18.571 --> 00:22:23.742
Overcoming any pain

00:22:23.742 --> 00:22:32.518
Shining light on the scenery

00:22:32.518 --> 00:22:36.255
Thoughts nestled fogether
on fwo overlapping shadows

00:22:36.255 --> 00:22:40.092
Grow smaller until they disappear

00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:43.562
Even though we hurt each other,
we always reach our again.

